{"id":"vod_sn_36390","vodId":"36390","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"龙珠GT","name_cn":"龙珠GT","date":"1996-01-01","year":"1996","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/c5d0fcb00e6bbfda527f1fd1ab154849.jpg"},"summary":"许多年过去，地球在Z战士的保卫下日渐和平与繁荣。某天，皮拉夫大王和他的爪牙历经千辛万苦来到神殿，找到了神仙与比克大魔王分身前制造的黑星龙珠。由于孙悟空的突然出现，皮拉夫慌忙之中许下让孙悟空变成少年模样的愿望。在此之后，黑星龙珠散落到宇宙各个角落，如果在一年之内无法找到七颗黑星龙珠的话，地球将会爆炸毁灭。情况危急，小悟空和孙女小芳开始了一段惊险刺激的宇宙大冒险。超级17号、邪恶龙等强大的对手接连出现，悟空面临更大的挑战……　　本片根据鸟山明人气原著漫画《龙珠》改编，不过剧情并非鸟山明原创，系东映动画公司取得授权后全新创作的动画。鸟山明参与了部分的人设工作。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:42:46","playable":true,"episodeCount":64,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wbDnBHuRqG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jrxCFsYLVJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/V6ciK3xXaE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4SE1brwXWP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/d95xdQzpDG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9MBV3vFCz81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/74RpCfFXa11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6vZ7ReCmUs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XtAdaVZj6t1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/AgzK4NRW5x1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FF2JuT1eTe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZfBBZQNUqb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZmR8DdTvQq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Fw2FF1Zf2n1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"